# Elements Section Automation

Turns manual test cases for the UI-Web-App Elements tab (http://localhost:5500)
into Playwright TypeScript specs, reusing this repo's existing Page Object
Model and fixtures.

## When to use

The user references a manual test case doc for an Elements-tab card
(`src/tests/manualTests/elements-section-*.md`, `Web Table_*.md`, or similar)
and asks to automate it, run it, or add more coverage to it.

## Steps

1. Locate the relevant manual TC doc under `src/tests/manualTests/` and read
   it in full — each TC's Preconditions/Steps/Test Data/Expected Result maps
   1:1 to one Playwright `test()`.
2. Reuse the matching Page Object in `src/pages/` (e.g. `TextInputsPage.ts`,
   `WebTablePage.ts`). If a needed UI step has no existing method, add one
   there or hand off to the `pom-builder` subagent rather than using raw
   locators inline in the spec.
3. Write or extend the spec in `src/tests/automatedTests/`:
   - Import `test`/`expect` from `../../fixtures/test-fixtures` (never
     `@playwright/test` directly).
   - One `test.describe` per card, `test.beforeEach` opens the page object.
   - Name each `test()` after its manual TC ID verbatim, e.g.
     `'TC_TI_01 - Validate with all fields empty shows required-field errors'`.
   - If the page object's fixture doesn't exist yet in
     `src/fixtures/test-fixtures.ts`, add it following the existing
     `webTablePage`/`textInputsPage` pattern.
4. Ensure the `UI-Web-App` server is running on `http://localhost:5500`
   before running specs.
5. Run `npx playwright test src/tests/automatedTests/<spec>.spec.ts` and
   `npm run lint:fix`; report pass/fail back rather than leaving a broken
   spec in the repo.

## Notes

- The app URL comes from `config.uiWebAppUrl` (`src/utils/config.ts`,
  `UI_WEB_APP_URL` env override) — Playwright's own `baseURL` in
  `playwright.config.ts` points at a different demo site, so Elements-tab
  page objects must call `this.goto(config.uiWebAppUrl)` explicitly in their
  `open()` method, not a relative path.
- Example pairing already in the repo: `src/tests/manualTests/elements-section-02.md`
  (TC_TI_01–TC_TI_04, Text Inputs) automated by
  `src/pages/TextInputsPage.ts` + `src/tests/automatedTests/textInputs.spec.ts`;
  `src/tests/manualTests/Web Table_01.md` (TC_WT_01–TC_WT_05) automated by
  `src/pages/WebTablePage.ts` + `src/tests/automatedTests/webTable.spec.ts`.
